<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29632" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύσχῐμος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>troublesome, dangerous,
				fearful</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δράκων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Th.</u>
					503
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλημμυρίς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					186
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέλευθοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					567
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					342
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χθών, πνεύματα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.</u>
				962
			</span></i> (lyr.). (It is doubtful whether -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χῐμος</span> (required by the metre in <i><span class="en">
				A.
			</span></i>) is cognate with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χεῖμα</span>,
				<i>hiems</i>, cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελάγ-χῐμος</span>: the form <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύσχειμος</span> is corrupt in <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				342
			</span></i>, E.ll.cc.)</div>
